    "innovation": "This report presents co-created, climate-smart marine spatial management scenarios for the East Marine Plan, demonstrating through stakeholder analysis that interventions for climate adaptation are more acceptable than the status-quo, particularly when supported by integrated evidence on their environmental, economic, and social outcomes.",
